<p>On Jan. 9, 1997 the company extinguished the debt on three mortgage loans with unpaid principal balances of approximately $18.7 million with proceeds from the Credit Facility.  As a result, the company incurred a loss from the early extinguishment of debt of approximately $1.2 million. Basis of Presentation</p>
